                    The classes below say which is which for the day that selector is re-aimed at
                    them; until then, do not reorder these two.

                    The attachment control depicts something that exists — apps/web's composer
                    uploads files onto a message — rather than a control the reference had and we
                    do not. */}
                <span class="chip chip-attach">
